// Bandit Level 6 → Level 7

URL: https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/

Step1: Log in to the Bandit Level 6 server using SSH:

        ssh bandit6@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step2: Enter the password obtained from Bandit Level 5.

Step3: We need to find a file somewhere on the server with the following properties:

        Owned by user: bandit7
        Owned by group: bandit6
        Size: 33 bytes

Step4: Use the `find` command from the root directory with these conditions:

        find / -user bandit7 -group bandit6 -size 33c 2>/dev/null

Step5: The command finds the required file.

Step6: Read the contents of the file using `cat`:

        cat /var/lib/dpkg/info/bandit7.password

Step7: The output is the password required to log in to the next level, `bandit7`.

Step8: Use the obtained password to connect to the next level:

        ssh bandit7@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step9: The Bandit Level 6 → Level 7 challenge is solved.

Step10: Congratulations!! you have solved this problem!!
